  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating Safer Space: Strengthening Civilian Protection Amidst Violent Conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling the creation of safe spaces for communities amidst violence and preventing displacement by enhancing unarmed civilian protection practices. Benefits prevention orgs, local communities in Colombia, Myanmar, South Sudan &amp; Philippines. SDGs:11,16,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
